420
00:15:01,508 --> 00:15:03,177
- Hello.
- Hello.

421
00:15:03,178 --> 00:15:04,478
- Hello.
- My gosh. Hello.

422
00:15:04,848 --> 00:15:06,777
- This is Go Soo.
- Hello.

423
00:15:06,778 --> 00:15:08,618
