442
00:15:41,918 --> 00:15:43,617
- Seowon Elementary and Junior High.
- Really?

443
00:15:43,618 --> 00:15:45,647
- Seowon Elementary and Junior High.
- Yes.

444
00:15:45,648 --> 00:15:47,817
