- She doesn't have much time left.

474
00:16:48,248 --> 00:16:49,547
- Lower graders, right?
- Yes.

475
00:16:49,548 --> 00:16:51,117
- Right.
- It gets crowded here.

476
00:16:51,118 --> 00:16:52,487
