1264
00:45:00,610 --> 00:45:02,679
We succeeded too easily at first.

1265
00:45:02,680 --> 00:45:04,249
That's because Seong Jae did a good job.

1266
00:45:04,250 --> 00:45:05,850
Seong Jae did a good job.

1267
00:45:06,390 --> 00:45:07,419
Seong Jae.

1268
00:45:07,420 --> 00:45:08,919
