1279
00:45:28,480 --> 00:45:29,709
- Hello.
- Hello.

1280
00:45:29,710 --> 00:45:30,810
- Hello.
- Four adults, please.

1281
00:45:33,410 --> 00:45:35,219
We don't know what the next game is yet, right?

1282
00:45:35,220 --> 00:45:37,449
