1288
00:45:48,930 --> 00:45:50,499
He's so funny.

1289
00:45:50,500 --> 00:45:52,400
Things are so different from the movie filming sets.

1290
00:45:52,670 --> 00:45:53,929
He's a natural entertainer.

1291
00:45:53,930 --> 00:45:55,839
