1446
00:51:12,320 --> 00:51:13,489
We should share this.

1447
00:51:13,490 --> 00:51:15,260
- They're really generous.
- That's the braised seafood.

1448
00:51:16,090 --> 00:51:17,260
This is the small size?

1449
00:51:19,390 --> 00:51:20,959
Enjoy your meal.

1450
00:51:20,960 --> 00:51:22,960
Enjoy your meal.

1451
00:51:23,730 --> 00:51:25,729
(He takes off his jacket and starts cutting.)

1452
00:51:25,730 --> 00:51:26,870
They're so generous.

1453
00:51:27,900 --> 00:51:30,599
