1454
00:51:30,600 --> 00:51:31,770
This is just...

1455
00:51:33,010 --> 00:51:34,140
Let's eat.

1456
00:51:34,910 --> 00:51:36,910
(You should eat too, cameraman.)

1457
00:51:37,540 --> 00:51:38,849
This looks good.

1458
00:51:38,850 --> 00:51:40,879
- Enjoy your meal.
- Enjoy your meal.

1459
00:51:40,880 --> 00:51:43,350
